      <div class="cultural-tips">
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Stone Town:</strong> Dress modestly (shoulders and knees covered). This is a conservative Muslim area.</li>
          <li><strong>Beaches:</strong> Swimwear is acceptable on the beach and at resorts.</li>
          <li><strong>During Ramadan:</strong> Avoid eating, drinking, or smoking in public during daylight hours.</li>
          <li><strong>General:</strong> When in doubt, dress more conservatively. Locals appreciate respect for their customs.</li>
          <li><strong>Shoes:</strong> Remove shoes when entering homes and some businesses.</li>
        </div>
